        "en": "Write up notes from a 60-minute Growth squad weekly — agenda, decisions, action items with owners, next meeting.",
        "zh-CN": "使用这个插件完成以下任务：Write up notes from a 60-minute Growth squad weekly — agenda, decisions, action items with owners, next meeting."
      },
